WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:17.890
I found it.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.200
You said you'd pay more than the others.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.880
I lied.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.610
I was on your fishing boat, the Astghik.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:26.120
I was the only one who survived.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:26.930
Where are you now?

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.590
Okay. Stay there. I got to go.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.130
The kids are ready. Who is that?

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.270
Oh, gosh, I almost forgot.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:35.120
And if I don't, then you'll lose.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.460
Your wife was a journalist the last couple of
years.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.520
Fent it's Laura.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.450
Nobody understands, do they?

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:43.390
One minute they're there and the next
minute.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.020
I need you boys to pack up your stuff
tomorrow.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.000
We're going to move to Bridgeport for the
summer.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.170
We're going to find out what happened to Mom.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.070
Hey. Hey. We believe you about what happened
on the Astghik.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:55.960
Does this mean anything to you?

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:56.690
That symbol.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.050
There's something inside. It's a box.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.450
That's what got everyone killed.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:04.060
I lied. Oh.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:04.460
Oh.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.040
Oh. Are you alright sir? He took my bag.

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:11.830
The guy got on a plane with his fake mustache
and then jumped off at 10,000ft.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:14.710
Oh, you're home.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:15.290
You're the guy.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.870
That jumped out of that plane. You're a
fugitive.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:17.930
Guilty.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.580
What'd you steal? The less you know, the
better.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.290
A box of your mom's things came to me.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.220
The strange tales of Bridgeport.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.900
Joe, Mom sent this out the day that she
died.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.410
Somebody killed Mom. Your wife was
investigating something.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.580
And my nephew Rupert was her source.

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:36.960
Do you remember any stories that your mother
was working on?

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.200
I mean, did you even know that she was
writing again?

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:39.970
No.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.680
You made a copy of the report.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.430
We got to take this to Dad's partner, Sam.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.780
J.P. Cox.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:46.300
This is the guy from the beach.

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.790
Take this envelope. Go to Stony Creek Park.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.360
Find a bench. You put it under it.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:52.110
I'm just telling them where to meet me.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:54.290
He hid this in the vent in my room.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:56.920
I think that's what the tall man was looking
for.

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:01.380
I had it with me during the carnival, and I
didn't lose a single game.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.700
Whoa. The tall guy killed all the people in
the hashtag.

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:05.830
Rally for the idol.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.790
Him and the guy from the beach.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.240
They're after the same thing?

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.800
Today's the day J.B. is going to meet his
buyer.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.190
If we find out who is after this thing.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:14.760
Then we find out who killed Mom.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:22.080
Joe! When I went back, the tall man found
us.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.930
He's not going to stop looking for it.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:27.230
So we're going to use that to our advantage
and we're going to trap him.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:31.320
We think that all of this has something to do
with what got her killed.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.420
I think it has something to do with my
grandmother and my great grandfather and this

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:36.070
weird power that they have over everything.

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.760
I'm just glad that you're here, because I
don't think I could have done this alone.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:40.740
If you found what was in the idol.

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:42.210
You held a piece of it.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:48.150
They called it the "Eye" because with it,
you could see what you needed to achieve all

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:48.670
your desires.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:52.250
I think there's something weird about that
new girl, Stacy.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:53.460
What's up with her?

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.520
Why are you so stuck on that girl? Or maybe
it's the fact that Frank stuck on her.

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:58.240
That's what's really bothering you.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:02:59.780
Who are you? Stacy.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:02.070
My name is Anastasia Nabokov.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:06.830
I think whoever killed your mother probably
got to my father, too.

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:08.060
Where's your nephew now?

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.240
Now? Three weeks ago, he disappeared.

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:12.900
And I believe you're the man to find him.

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.490
Rupert Conn. You knew my wife.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.350
I was helping her to destroy the circle of
the eye.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.550
Ever since I heard, they found that piece on
the boat.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:26.120
I've been thinking about my successor.

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.310
The legacy of the eye will fall to you,
Francis.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:33.720
The only place the Eye can be broken or
reforged is in the chamber of the Eye where

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:34.510
we discovered it.

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.580
I think that it's the only place it can be
destroyed as well.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.200
She said her family was running the town.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.610
You're making them sound like they're a
secret organization.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:42.620
That's what they are.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:48.570
They called themselves the "Circle of the
Eye", the Nabokovs, the Khans, and the

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:49.270
Estabrooks.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:51.030
Did Mom know about all of this?

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:56.170
Laura was very good at finding herself in
places she was not supposed to be.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:02.370
Laura, you must never let your mother or
anyone else reassemble the Eye.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.100
Mom wanted to expose the truth and bring down
the circle.

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.850
You don't want to destroy the eye, you want
it for yourself.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.400
You're the same as everyone else.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:18.280
You know, whatever happens now is on you.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:20.410
Did you bring it?

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:23.440
Yes. Where is she? The piece.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:27.480
Frank! Kelly!

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:28.600
Don't give her the peace.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:34.780
Stacey is insane. You should have never given
her the piece.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:35.660
We didn't...

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:36.880
Did it happen?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.650
I gave them the girl. They gave me the piece.

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:45.430
Well hand it over. I don't.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.630
It worked before I...

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.160
Stop! Oh...

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.870
Frank... Perfect timing. Fun's just about to
start.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.130
It's over. We know everything.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:00.620
You know nothing.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.090
We have you on tape with Kanika Khan.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.470
We know that you killed Victor Nabokov.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:11.170
Stacey. I swear I didn't know.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:14.500
I should have destroyed all the Estabrooks.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.640
You took everything away from me.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:21.120
Your father knew what he was getting into
when he came for my piece of the eye.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.840
You deserve each other.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:27.820
Get it now. Get the piece!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:31.820
Remember me?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.590
Frank! Help!

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.790
Frank! She's putting

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:29.040
it together! Frank...

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:29.800
It's me. It's Joe.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.120
That's not the argument you had with her.

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.940
The day she died. You knew she was in danger.

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:38.480
You knew they were going to kill her. And
you just let it happen.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:38.570
No.

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.410
I warned her I couldn't protect her anymore.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.540
You didn't want to protect her.

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.720
No, no, no. She didn't give me a chance.

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:48.420
She was so angry with me.

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:53.190
She cared more about exposing the circle
than she did about her own safety.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.450
You chose the eye over your own daughter.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:00.170
You were the only other person who saw the
argument between my mom and grandmother.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:01.880
You knew about the Astghik.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:02.500
It was you...

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:03.700
You killed her.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:06.360
No, no, no, no. That's ridiculous.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.590
It's ridiculous. Tell them. Tell them.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:09.420
That's wrong.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:15.560
You couldn't have. You wanted to use the Eye
to do more than your father to do better.

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:16.980
She would have ruined it all.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.170
What? She would have exposed everything.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:20.790
I did it for you.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:22.620
She was my daughter.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.320
The chamber is collapsing.

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:30.400
Go. I'll get the eye.

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:36.260
Gloria Estabrook, you're under arrest for the
murder of Victor Nabokov.

